    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bas6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sas5",
          "text": "Motorists and cyclists need to operate most safely and respectfully possible. To avoid bike crashes altogether, it is crucial everyone learn the laws governing interactions between cyclists and motor vehicles before setting out on the roads.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bas8",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sas7",
          "text": "Product Defects and Bicycle Accidents",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "basg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lasa",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-product-liability-lawyer/"
        },
        {
          "_key": "lasd",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/results/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sas9",
          "text": "Driver error is the number one cause of bicycle accidents in Colorado. However, historically, many fatal accidents and injuries have also been caused by ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sasb",
          "text": "product defects",
          "marks": [
            "lasa"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sasc",
          "text": ". A defective bicycle may experience a failure with its frame, wheels or brakes during a ride that causes a harmful accident. In addition, bicycle helmet defects can contribute to serious and deadly traumatic brain injuries in bicycle accidents. Dormer Harpring has experience litigating defective bicycle helmet cases against well-known bicycle and helmet manufacturers ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sase",
          "text": "and winning",
          "marks": [
            "lasd"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sasf",
          "text": ".",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "basi",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sash",
          "text": "Bicycle Accident Statistics",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bask",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sasj",
          "text": "Motor vehicle drivers can put bicyclists at risk when they fail to pay attention to the road or are careless behind the wheel. Unfortunately, these are common mistakes that lead to a high number of bicycle accidents each year. The National Safety Council reports that preventable deaths from bicycle accidents increased by 16 percent from 2019 to 2020, and 44 percent over the last decade. Nonfatal bicycle accident injuries also increased by 5 percent in 2020 compared to 2019.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bass",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lasm",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.iihs.org/topics/fatality-statistics/detail/bicyclists"
        },
        {
          "_key": "lasp",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.codot.gov/safety/traffic-safety/data-analysis/fatal-crash-data"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sasl",
          "text": "In 2021, 961 bicyclists were killed in the U.S., according to the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sasn",
          "text": "Insurance Institute for Highway Safety",
          "marks": [
            "lasm"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saso",
          "text": ". In Colorado, the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sasq",
          "text": "Department of Transportation",
          "marks": [
            "lasp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sasr",
          "text": " reported 20 bicyclist fatalities in 2023, the highest since 2019. Data for 2021 and 2022 also shows 15 bicyclist deaths per year, indicating that bicyclist fatalities are on the rise. These deaths account for just over 2 percent of the total death toll in Colorado traffic accidents annually. The highest number of fatal bicycle accidents in Colorado occur in the summertime, peaking in August.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "basu",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sast",
          "text": "Common Injuries After a Bicycle Accident",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "basz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lasw",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-car-accident-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sasv",
          "text": "The human body is not built to withstand the forces exerted upon it when ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sasx",
          "text": "hit by a car",
          "marks": [
            "lasw"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sasy",
          "text": ". Even on a bicycle, you are barely protected from the full impact of the collision. Unfortunately, this can lead to devastating physical injuries, as well as significant psychological harm from the trauma of the event. Due to the mechanics of the average bicycle accident, the most common injuries bicycle accident victims suffered include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bat1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
