    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "batp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "satn",
          "text": "Serious injuries can significantly impact the quality of life for a cyclist. Some may never fully heal from their injuries or be able to ride a bike ever again. Even minor injuries can result in a great deal of pain, inconvenience and medical costs. If you or a loved one was diagnosed with any type of injury after a bike accident in Denver, our lawyers can help you demand justice.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "batr",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "satq",
          "text": "Compensation for Bicycle Accidents in Denver",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "batt",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sats",
          "text": "Victims of bicycle accidents often face extensive injuries and enormous accident-related medical bills. Accident rehabilitation is costly and may take years to accomplish physically. Compensation for bicycle accidents should pay for current and future estimated costs to cover all of an injured cyclist’s mental, physical, and emotional recovery.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "batv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "satu",
          "text": "While bicycle accident compensation amounts vary, the kinds of damages available include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "batx",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "satw",
          "text": "Past and future accident-related medical bills",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "batz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saty",
          "text": "Property damage",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
